  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Product Application"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This round hygrometer, when combined with a 3D-printed desiccant box, efficiently monitors the storage environment of your 3D printing materials."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "With the precisely designed AMS desiccant box, you can easily install the hygrometer in the designated position without any tilt, keeping humidity data clearly visible."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The model securely holds the hygrometer and allows for additional desiccant, maximizing material preservation while ensuring the hygrometer remains functional and accessible."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Product Feature"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Small, durable, and portable | Monitor the temperature and humidity values | Fast response time,with a measurement cycle of 10 seconds"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Can be switched between Fahrenheit and Celsius with a double-click the ℃/℉ conversion button on the back | Rated voltage is DC 1.5V (1x LR44 button cell battery)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Considerations"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "The device is rated for use in ambient temperatures from -10°C to 60°C, but the display operates reliably only between -5°C and 50°C. Using the device outside this display temperature range may cause slow response, screen lag, or other visual anomalies."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Avoid prolonged use or storage in extreme temperatures. Extended exposure to -10°C or below may cause moisture-sensitive components to freeze and sustain permanent damage. Similarly, continuous operation at 60°C or above can lead to gradual screen dimming, eventual blackouts, and potential damage to heat-sensitive parts. For optimal performance and longevity, avoid prolonged use in extreme temperatures."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Documentation</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile pct_downloadContent\" style=\"text-align: center; gap: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"><a href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/89b6de92f959430ab4dd9e7b2f667ba8/B-XF001.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <img alt=\"2D\" class=\"download_svg product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/4036/9460/files/2d.svg?v=1715161943\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <span>Specification</span> </a> <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0584/7236/6216/files/Circular_Embedded_Electronic_Digital_Thermometer_Hygrometer.zip?v=1719819517\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <img alt=\"3D\" class=\"download_svg product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/4036/9460/files/3d.svg?v=1715161943\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <span>3D Model</span> </a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpcic\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 左侧文案部分 -->\n<d