pan></span><span>Shell Material</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><span></span><span></span><span>ABS</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Device  Operating Temperature</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><span></span><span></span><span> -10°C to 60°C</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Temperature Measurement Range</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><span></span><span></span><span>-50°C to 70℃</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\"><span></span><span></span><span>Temperature Accuracy</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><span></span><span></span><span>±1℃</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- table布局 --></div>\n<!-- 第二条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic-p\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- table布局 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\" style=\"padding: 0;\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\"><span></span><span></span><span>Display Screen</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"><span></span><span></span><span>LCD</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19.5938px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\"><span></span>Display Operating Temperature</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"><span></span>-5°C to 50°C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19.5938px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\"><span></span><span></span><span>Humidity Measurement Range</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"><span></span><span></span><span>20% to 90%</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19.5938px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\"><span></span><span></span><span>Humidity Accuracy</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"><span></span><span></span><span> ±5%</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- table布局 --></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 如需添加在此处添加 --></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 标题加文案结束 --></div>\n<!-- 如需添加在此处添加 --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpcic\">\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Product Feature</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span></span><span></span><span>Small, durable, and portable</span>       |        <span>Monitor the temperature and humidity values</span>       |      <span></span><span></span><span>Fast response time,with a measurement cycle of 10 seconds</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>Can be switched between Fahrenheit and Celsius with a double-click the ℃/℉ conversion button on the back       |        Rated voltage is DC 1.5V (1x LR44 button cell battery)</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Considerations</h2>\n<p> </p>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RoJqddxgJoenInxxBbUcA3pznoh\" data-list=\"bullet\">The device is rated for use in ambient temperatures from -10°C to 60°C, but the display operates reliably only between -5°C and 50°C. Using the device outside this display temperature range may cause slow response, screen lag, or other visual anomalies. </li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RoJqddxgJoenInxxBbUcA3pznoh\" data-list=\"bullet\">Avoid prolonged use or storage in extreme temperatures. Extended exposure to -10°C or below may cause moisture-sensitive components to freeze and sustain permanent damage. Similarly, continuous operation at 60°C or above can lead to gradual screen dimming, eventual blackouts, and potential damage to heat-sensitive parts. For optimal performance and longevity, avoid prolonged use in extreme temperatures.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "This round hygrometer, when combined with a 3D-printed desiccant box, efficiently monitors the storage environment of your 3D printing materials.\n\nWith the precisely designed AMS desiccant box, you can easily install the hygrometer in the designated position without any tilt, keeping humidity data clearly visible.\n\nThe model securely holds the hygrometer and allows for additional desiccant, maximizing material preservation while ensuring the hygrometer remains functional and accessible.\n\nSmall, durable, and portable | Monitor the temperature and humidity values | Fast response time,with a measurement cycle of 10 seconds\n\nCan be switched between Fahrenheit and Celsius with a double-click the ℃/℉ conversion button on the back | Rated voltage is DC 1.5V (1x LR44 button cell battery)\n\nThe device is rated for use in ambient temperatures from -10°C to 60°C, but the display operates reliably only between -5°C and 50°C. Using the device outside this display temperature range may cause slow response, screen lag, or other visual anomalies.\n\nAvoid prolonged use or storage in extreme temperatures. Extended exposure to -10°C or below may cause moisture-sensitive components to freeze and sustain permanent damage. Similarly, continuous operation at 60°C or above can lead to gradual screen dimming, eventual blackouts, and potential damage to heat-sensitive parts. For optimal performance and longevity, avoid prolonged use in extreme temperatures.",
